        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cognitive Displacement</strong> is a simple, small-scale management game where you take on the role of a junior manager running a remote research outpost. Oversee daily operations, keep your staff working smoothly, and guide the facility through its early development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in <strong>Very Early Access</strong>, built with community feedback in mind.<br>Your suggestions, ideas, and complaints help shape development in real time.<br><br>    Current Gameplay Loop<br>- Queue Research to Gain Resources<br>- Wait for it complete (More minigames coming soon)<br>- Oversee the Defence every night<br>- Allocate Resources to Strenghten Defences<br>- Survive Until day 30 (30 minutes per day)<br><br>    Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign research projects and watch progress unfold over time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downtime matters: sit back and monitor progress, or jump into the small <strong>Tablet</strong> minigame to pass the shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple upgrades and trinkets unlocked by completed research.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused, minimalist gameplay that emphasizes pacing and decisions over micromanagement.<br><br><strong>📌 Important Notes Before You Buy</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Saving is still under active development, Game may require restarting each launch </span> Fixed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">The game may require restarting between major updates </span> Should'nt be a problem now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features, mechanics, and visuals will continue to evolve based on community input</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognitive Displacement is only a fraction of the planned final version — but it will grow, improve, and be refined continuously to the best of my abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like small experimental management games and enjoy watching a project evolve, this early stage is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163440/extras/35ec02e804aff7150f76268f6ab44b80.avif?t=1771770619\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cognitive Displacement</strong> is a simple, small-scale management game where you take on the role of a junior manager running a remote research outpost. Oversee daily operations, keep your staff working smoothly, and guide the facility through its early development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in <strong>Very Early Access</strong>, built with community feedback in mind.<br>Your suggestions, ideas, and complaints help shape development in real time.<br><br>    Current Gameplay Loop<br>- Queue Research to Gain Resources<br>- Wait for it complete (More minigames coming soon)<br>- Oversee the Defence every night<br>- Allocate Resources to Strenghten Defences<br>- Survive Until day 30 (30 minutes per day)<br><br>    Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign research projects and watch progress unfold over time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downtime matters: sit back and monitor progress, or jump into the small <strong>Tablet</strong> minigame to pass the shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple upgrades and trinkets unlocked by completed research.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused, minimalist gameplay that emphasizes pacing and decisions over micromanagement.<br><br><strong>📌 Important Notes Before You Buy</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Saving is still under active development, Game may require restarting each launch </span> Fixed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">The game may require restarting between major updates </span> Should'nt be a problem now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features, mechanics, and visuals will continue to evolve based on community input</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognitive Displacement is only a fraction of the planned final version — but it will grow, improve, and be refined continuously to the best of my abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like small experimental management games and enjoy watching a project evolve, this early stage is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163440/extras/35ec02e804aff7150f76268f6ab44b80.avif?t=1771770619\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>",
